# Copy to `.env` / `.env.local` for Vite dev server.
#
# The app always calls the API through the same-origin `/api/1.0` path.
# In development, Vite proxies `/api` to this target.
# Leave empty for the default local backend: http://localhost:5000
#
# Examples:
# VITE_DEV_API_PROXY=https://staging.example.com
# VITE_DEV_API_PROXY=https://185-10-20-30.sslip.io
VITE_DEV_API_PROXY=
